sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor V as Visitor / Vendor
    actor AD as Admin
    participant F as Next.js frontend
    participant A as Express API
    participant M as MongoDB
    participant B as Cloud Storage
    participant J as Scheduled jobs
    participant G as e-GP
    participant AI as Gemini
    participant X as Email service

    rect rgb(240, 246, 252)
    Note over J,B: 1. Bring TORs in (hourly)
    J->>G: search software projects, fetch details
    J->>M: save new or changed TORs
    J->>B: store each TOR PDF
    J->>M: queue the software-related ones for AI
    end

    rect rgb(245, 240, 252)
    Note over J,AI: 2. Understand them with AI (every 15 minutes)
    J->>B: read the PDF
    J->>AI: one call: classify, summarize, find fairness signals
    AI-->>J: result
    J->>M: publish software TORs with summary and flags
    end

    rect rgb(240, 250, 244)
    Note over J,V: 3. Refresh and tell vendors
    J->>G: read procurement stage and bid deadline
    J->>M: save stage, create match notifications
    J->>X: send digest emails
    X-->>V: email about matching TORs
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 235)
    Note over V,B: 4. People use the site
    V->>F: search, open a TOR
    F->>A: GET /api/tors
    A->>M: read published TORs only
    A-->>F: TORs
    F-->>V: list, AI summary, fairness signals
    V->>A: GET /api/tors/:id/document
    A->>B: stream the PDF
    B-->>V: PDF
    opt signed-in vendor
        V->>A: profile, bookmarks, saved searches, hide a TOR
        A->>M: save
        V->>A: read notifications and matches
    end
    end

    rect rgb(252, 244, 240)
    Note over V,M: 5. Keep the data right
    V->>A: report incorrect data
    A->>M: save the report
    AD->>F: sign in with 2FA, open the admin panel
    F->>A: review queue, flagged TORs, logs
    A->>M: read
    AD->>A: correct the TOR, resolve reports, hide a TOR
    A->>M: save and write the audit trail
    AD->>A: start a run now, or send projects from the Chrome extension
    A->>G: same ingestion code as step 1
    end
